<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Tremblingly a sinner bowed before His face,</l><l>Naught I knew of pardon, God’s free grace;</l><l>Heard a voice so melting, “Cease thy wild regret,</l><l>Jesus bought thy pardon, paid thy debt.”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O ’twas wondrous love the Savior showed for me!</l><l>When He left His throne for Calvary,</l><l>When He bore my trespass, bore it all alone;</l><l>Praise His Name forever, make it known.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
